# Line endings: normalized to LF in the repository and on checkout.
#
# Windows tooling rewrites files with CRLF, which makes them show as modified
# when nothing changed. In a module repo that churn is worse than cosmetic — it
# makes "the frozen snapshot is untouched" impossible to assert. Every blob in HEAD is already LF, so this is a policy declaration and not a rewrite — the deal-desk data freeze under data/raw/ is committed LF and stays byte-identical.

* text=auto eol=lf

# Binaries: never examined for line endings, never normalized.
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif  binary
*.ico  binary
*.pdf  binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.zip  binary
*.gz   binary
*.skill binary
